[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":37},["ShallowReactive",2],{"useQiitaArticleDetailFetcher":3,"useQiitaAuthorizedUser":35},{"rendered_body":4,"body":5,"coediting":6,"comments_count":7,"created_at":8,"group":9,"id":10,"likes_count":7,"private":6,"reactions_count":7,"stocks_count":7,"tags":11,"title":24,"updated_at":25,"url":26,"user":27,"page_views_count":34,"team_membership":9,"organization_url_name":9,"slide":6},"\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:9\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"概要\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#%E6%A6%82%E8%A6%81\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>概要\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-4:54\">Reactで書いたコードで↓のエラーが発生したので対処方法メモ\u003Cbr>\n\u003Ccode>TypeError: Cannot read property 'map' of undefined\u003C/code>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:9\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"原因\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>原因\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:75\">mapメソッドを使っている配列にデータが入ってなかった\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-frame\" data-lang=\"text\" data-sourcepos=\"10:1-15:3\">\u003Cdiv class=\"highlight\">\u003Cpre>\u003Ccode>cost abc[] = fetch('https://abcdef.com/') &lt;=データ取れてない\nconst abc.map(function(val){\n    return val\n})\n\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"17:1-18:66\">##解決方法\u003Cbr>\nAPIのエンドポイントが間違っていたため、修正。\u003C/p>\n","## 概要\n\nReactで書いたコードで↓のエラーが発生したので対処方法メモ\n``TypeError: Cannot read property 'map' of undefined``\n\n\n## 原因\nmapメソッドを使っている配列にデータが入ってなかった\n\n```\ncost abc[] = fetch('https://abcdef.com/') \u003C=データ取れてない\nconst abc.map(function(val){\n    return val\n})\n```\n\n##解決方法\nAPIのエンドポイントが間違っていたため、修正。\n",false,0,"2021-06-29T03:32:04+09:00",null,"0e5695c404a49174b908",[12,15,18,21],{"name":13,"versions":14},"JavaScript",[],{"name":16,"versions":17},"error",[],{"name":19,"versions":20},"map",[],{"name":22,"versions":23},"React",[],"TypeError: Cannot read property 'map' of undefined","2024-11-26T23:16:07+